  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Baby Bitch** (1 review): It gets an unusual arrangement that differs from the album version [3]\n- **Poopship Destroyer** (1 review): The reviewer singles it out as a highlight of the recording [5]\n- **Fluffy** (1 review): The attendee was left stunned by this song live [8]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Pretty Girl**: rare: 12 archived performances [9]\n- **Help Me Scape The Mucus Off My Brain**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [9]\n- **I Saw Gener Cryin' Crying in His Sleep**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [9]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1996-10-05.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 118 min; rated 5/5 by 7 [1]. Said about its sound: The reviewer says the recording sounds good [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Ween performed this show with the Shit Creek Boys [2]\n- The band's stage banter between songs is described as good [6]\n- An attendee recalls dancing at a foam party and dancing with Dean and Gene Ween [7]\n- Songs from 12 Golden Country Greats are reproduced faithfully, alongside some reworked arrangements [3]\n- The reviewer had been waiting for a show from the Shit Creek era to be posted [4]\n- An attendee calls it the best country show they have seen [8]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1996-10-05.flac16**: taped by unknown; transferred by Lobster; source: Neumann KM140 > DA-P1 > Cass/1 [1]",
